{"resourceIdentifier":"4564","resourceName":"7.5 MW Waste-to-Energy Power Plant by Goodwatts WTE Jamnagar Private Limited in Gujarat, India","description":"The main purpose of this project activity is to generate clean form of electricity through waste to energy-based power generation. The plant utilizes the Refuse-Derived Fuel (“RDF”) as feedstock derived from the separation and sorting of Municipal Solid Waste (“MSW”) excluding the recyclable or potentially hazardous materials from the waste stream. The MSW is sourced from the Jamnagar City and the project will utilise about 311 ton of RDF per day and generate electricity with the installed capacity of 7.5 MW. The project avoids CH4 emission from avoidance of waste going to landfills and also avoids CO2 emission by replacing grid electricity.","location":{"latitude":22.495785,"longitude":70.066783},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-13","endExclusive":"2023-10-14","endInclusive":"2023-10-13"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4564"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gujarat"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Goodwatts WTE Jamnagar Private Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"GUJARAT, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"46759"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.E."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/